          "endLine": 17
        },
        "quote": "/** Compare scores only within one model's evaluated subset. With partial work,\n * replace evaluated slots in fallback order; untouched slots stay in place.\n * No synthetic zero score or uncalibrated blend with retrieval scores is needed. */\nexport function evaluatedOrder<T>(\n  hits: T[],\n  score: (hit: T) => number | "
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "已评估槽位回填实现",
        "reason": "支持提取有分候选、按分数和原索引排序，再把结果回填到已评分槽位的流程与回调调用方式。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/retrieval/evaluated-order.ts",
          "startLine": 8,
          "endLine": 17
        },
        "quote": "  const evaluated = hits\n    .flatMap((hit, index) => {\n      const value = score(hit);\n      return value === undefined ? [] : [{ hit, index, value }];\n    })\n    .sort((a, b) => b.value - a.value || a.index - b.index);\n  let next = 0;\n  return hits.map((hit) =>\n    score(hit) === undefined ? hit : evaluated[next++]!."
      },
